WEBVTT

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:03.710
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.570
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.050
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.050
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.430
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.430
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.410
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.920
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.010
Episode 32

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.010
The Scream of Perfect Chaos

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:39.570
Shoot!

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:44.250
Chris hasn't come to school.

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:47.000
If there are any changes, I'll contact you.

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:51.710
Mr. Stewart, please get the ball!

00:01:53.210 --> 00:01:55.170
Why don't you join us, Mr. Stewart!

00:01:55.670 --> 00:01:56.170
You don't mind?

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:57.630
Of course not!

00:01:57.630 --> 00:01:58.510
Okay.

00:02:02.050 --> 00:02:03.220
Here goes!

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:09.060
Wow! I see you in a whole new light, Mr. Stewart!

00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:13.110
I used to be a pretty good back in the day.

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:17.900
What is it, Helen?

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:21.070
You're starting to act like a real teacher.

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:24.330
Staying at this school forever might suit you.

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:26.370
You think so?

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:30.630
He's not here.

00:02:30.630 --> 00:02:32.460
I wonder where he went?

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:37.840
I guess I'll just wait for a while.

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:45.770
Though we went through a lot, we ended up together in this world again.

00:02:58.490 --> 00:03:00.070
It's Knuckles.

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:05.080
Eggman.

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:06.120
Yeah.

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:08.250
What happened?

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:11.210
Beats me. I found him lying here.

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:17.800
He's alive!

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:20.380
It's Chaos.

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:21.930
Chaos?

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:24.180
It's still alive.

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:25.300
Still alive?

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:29.430
It's finally not listening to me anymore.

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:31.480
Tell us more in detail!

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:33.270
Cut it out, Knuckles!

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:38.940
You're so violent! If anything happens to me, I'll haunt you as a ghost!

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:42.950
He's already a ghost.

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:47.950
We've come to retrieve Dr. Eggman.

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:50.290
We're sorry for all the trouble we caused.

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:53.460
Why are you apologizing to Sonic?

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:55.750
It's good to be humble every now and then.

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:57.840
Getting all worked up isn't helpful.

00:03:57.840 --> 00:04:01.800
Shut up! This is all Chaos's fault!

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:04.550
Immediately head to Point X!

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:05.720
Okay!

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:14.270
If what Eggman said was true, then Chaos is an unbelievable monster.

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:17.900
If it gets hold of the seven Chaos Emeralds…

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:19.280
I know.

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:28.370
Why does this have to happen again now?

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:41.880
That's...

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:53.730
If we acquire the seven Emeralds, we will have absolute power.

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:55.980
People's ambitions are limitless.

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:58.730
Please stop what you're doing!

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:02.230
I can't keep wasting my time on nonsense from a child!

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:04.200
Forget about her! Go!

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:07.110
No!

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:46.150
What?

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:12.560
They all vanished.

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:13.510
You're wrong.

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:17.100
Pull yourself together!

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:28.570
No... It can't be...

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:32.320
This must be a lie!

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:34.950
Hey!

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:46.460
What must be done... The seven chaos.

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:51.590
Chaos is power. Power comes from the heart.

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:55.640
The one who masters that also controls chaos.

00:06:56.850 --> 00:07:00.940
The seven Emeralds transforms a person's will into power.

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:04.650
This Emerald keeps that power in check.

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:07.990
Please stop it!

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:20.500
Are you two okay?

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:23.630
Did you see her?

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:27.460
Yeah. What was she trying to tell us?

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:31.050
Fortunately, the seven Chaos Emeralds haven't been gathered.

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:32.380
Knuckles!

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:46.400
Chris!

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:51.360
Chris!

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:54.740
Hang on!

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:16.010
The seven Chaos Emeralds are now all together.

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:19.180
I'm sorry. It's my fault.

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:23.770
Don't be. The Chaos Emeralds originally belonged to it.

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:25.770
This might be fate.

00:08:27.560 --> 00:08:29.020
That Chaos!

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:57.760
There are more fools in this city.

00:08:57.760 --> 00:09:02.020
But that means fun for me, the 'Electric Shock Racer.'

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:07.810
What? Did the water pipe burst?

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:13.690
This is bad.

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:27.460
Evacuate into the building! Hurry!

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:45.680
We're about to arrive on scene.

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:52.780
The only details we have is that an enormous amount of water gushed out from Station Square's main street.

00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:57.150
This is...

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:00.070
What is that?

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:03.040
What is that? Someone explain!

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:06.080
Stay calm and report the story, Scarlet.

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:08.210
It's impossible to launch an attack from the ground.

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:10.830
We also can't act without your orders.

00:10:10.830 --> 00:10:13.550
Use your own discretion and do something!

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:16.380
I'm the highest commanding officer of the military!

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:18.510
Stop wasting time and get ready to attack!

00:10:23.180 --> 00:10:26.480
Station Square's central area is completely destroyed.

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:28.890
Everyone, stay calm and evacuate!

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:33.570
What's wrong, Cheese?

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:38.320
Maybe it's scared.

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:41.370
Don't worry. There's nothing to be afraid of, Cheese.

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:45.120
What are you doing?

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:46.790
We must leave immediately!

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:50.620
But Chris isn't back yet.

00:10:50.670 --> 00:10:51.790
What?

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:55.670
It's all my fault.

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:57.550
Please hurry, Tails!

00:10:57.550 --> 00:10:58.920
I know!

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:07.560
If that really happened, then I…

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:20.650
Please calm down!

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:21.990
Everyone, calm down!

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:28.950
Everyone, evacuate to the mountain in the rear!

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:31.870
Teacher here.

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:33.710
This is an emergency.

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:35.710
Contact them immediately!

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:41.930
But I'm busy right now!

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:44.930
Didn't you hear me? This is an order!

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:49.560
There's so much static that I can't hear you.

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:51.140
Ending transmission.

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:52.810
Mr. Stewart!

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:54.350
Are you the last ones?

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:55.770
Yes.

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:58.150
Okay, follow me!

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:09.080
When Chris returns, I will protect him even if it means risking my life.

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:10.830
Let's go.

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:30.310
Thank you.

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:31.810
You saved my life.

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:37.400
Haven't I seen you before?

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:40.820
Never mind that. Do you know where Vivian is?

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:48.080
All right! Hurry up and defeat that monster!

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:50.660
Let's spread out and attack.

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:52.160
Fox, roger.

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:53.410
Coyote, roger.

00:12:57.710 --> 00:12:59.540
Switch to missile attacks.

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:06.970
The missiles were...

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:30.490
Sonic, please come.

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:39.540
We're ready to launch!

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:40.790
Take off!

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:46.130
I constructed Egg Carrier 2 just in case for times like this.

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:52.140
They'll learn that the genius Dr. Eggman is the one who's going to get the last laugh!

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:01.440
What an unbelievable monster.

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:03.480
But I'm not going to let you have your way!

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:07.740
It's Sonic!

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:26.970
Oh my!

00:14:28.630 --> 00:14:30.140
Sonic!

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:35.100
Are you all right?

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:36.640
Thanks, buddy!

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:39.140
Sonic, I…

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:41.860
Don't mind, Chris.

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:46.360
Anyway, it's more powerful than anyone we've fought so far, so I'm counting on you to back me up.

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:47.820
Yeah!

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:49.910
Okay, let's go!

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:03.130
Move out of the way, Sonic!

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:10.760
Eggman? I didn't know he had that!

00:15:13.930 --> 00:15:16.310
All gun ports are open.

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:19.480
The Eggman Cannon is now fully charged!

00:15:19.480 --> 00:15:24.900
Listen, Chaos! If you won't follow my orders, you have no reason to exist!

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:26.730
Attack it with everything!

00:15:38.410 --> 00:15:40.290
Oh no!

00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:43.170
Damn, it's out of control!

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:03.350
Tell me. Who are you?

00:16:06.570 --> 00:16:08.020
Tikal?

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:17.370
My soul has stayed alongside it throughout time to keep its power under control.

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:22.160
However, an evil black heart awakened it.

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:24.120
You mean Eggman.

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:41.310
It has absorbed the power of the Emeralds.

00:16:41.310 --> 00:16:42.480
What?

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:47.110
It extracted the power of the Emeralds using anger and sadness.

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:54.240
If we don't hurry up and seal it inside the Master Emerald, it will destroy this world, just like it did mine!

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:55.200
We can't do that.

00:16:56.700 --> 00:17:02.250
Even if you keep it under control with your sadness, it will just be the same as before!

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:04.920
Then what should we do?

00:17:11.250 --> 00:17:13.380
Sonic!

00:17:15.050 --> 00:17:17.340
I picked this up. Here you go.

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:21.350
Cheese is acting strange.

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:23.560
Sonic!

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:31.980
This was my lucky charm, but I'll lend it to you.

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:37.860
Sonic, I'm sure you know the real way to use the Emeralds.

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:42.620
I hate to admit it, but you're the only one who can do it.

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:44.830
Everyone...

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:47.420
Hey!

00:17:49.130 --> 00:17:51.290
Fine. Here.

00:17:51.290 --> 00:17:53.090
Just one more left.

00:17:53.090 --> 00:17:56.420
Sonic, I found it!

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:00.220
Chris!

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:02.600
Sonic!

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:07.440
We've gathered them all.

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:11.400
Sonic!

00:18:11.690 --> 00:18:12.820
Sonic!

00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:14.820
Sonic!

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:26.540
Power has returned to the Emeralds!

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:50.440
Anger and sadness are not the only methods to draw power out of the Chaos Emeralds.

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:54.480
Power comes from the heart.

00:18:54.480 --> 00:18:58.700
We care about Sonic, and he cares about us.

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:02.780
That heart can also create tremendous power.

00:19:32.600 --> 00:19:34.400
Sonic!

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:39.030
I'm your opponent!

00:19:49.580 --> 00:19:52.830
Please protect our town, Sonic.

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:54.880
Sonic!

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:18.530
It's my turn. Go!

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:53.640
It's still alive!

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:07.280
It no longer has the urge to destroy?

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:11.950
Super Sonic's power probably erased it.

00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:13.830
There are so many Chao!

00:21:13.830 --> 00:21:15.620
Chao of this world?

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:19.670
Come to think of it, there were many wild Chao in Tanaka's hometown.

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:29.470
They're the Chao that you protected.

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:39.730
Their lives are connected to this world.

00:21:40.610 --> 00:21:44.240
It's fine. It's fine now.

00:21:49.570 --> 00:21:51.240
Thank you.

00:22:15.930 --> 00:22:18.140
Where's Eggman?

00:22:18.140 --> 00:22:20.310
He left a while ago.

00:22:20.770 --> 00:22:22.900
When it comes to running away, he's fast.

00:22:25.650 --> 00:22:27.150
Sonic.

00:22:29.950 --> 00:22:31.490
It's over.

00:22:39.960 --> 00:22:44.130
I'm not getting a bite.

00:22:45.070 --> 00:22:54.450
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:45.070 --> 00:22:54.450
<i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i>

00:22:54.450 --> 00:23:03.420
<b>Ai suru to kime kisae namida ni ujirareteru</b>

00:22:54.450 --> 00:23:03.420
<i>The nervousness of love is sealed by tears.</i>

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:12.300
<b>Boy boy futari de jumon wo sagashi ni ikou</b>

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:12.300
<i>Boy, let’s search for a spell together,</i>

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:21.900
<b>Kinji rareta yume wo kanaerareru kuni he</b>

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:21.900
<i>To a land where our forbidden dreams can come true.</i>

00:23:22.770 --> 00:23:30.840
<b>Dare ni mo naisho de ashita na tchi awaseshiyou</b>

00:23:22.770 --> 00:23:30.840
<i>Let’s secretly meet tomorrow.</i>

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:41.040
<b>Itsuka kotori wo ume ta yowake no mieru oka de</b>

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:41.040
<i>At the place where we buried the bird, the hill where we can see the sunrise.</i>

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:49.800
<b>Tsumetai asamoya kimi to te wo tsunaidara</b>

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:49.800
<i>In the cold morning mist, if I hold hands with you.</i>

00:23:50.550 --> 00:23:58.970
<b>Hikaru michi no fuuin ga tokeru yo</b>

00:23:50.550 --> 00:23:58.970
<i>The seal to the shining path will be broken.</i>

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:03.810
<b>Hateshinaku</b>

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:03.810
<i>Forever...</i>

00:24:30.130 --> 00:25:35.360
The Puzzle of Project Shadow
